and all of a sudden Krashen, Dr.

00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:30.270
Krashen he presented, uh...

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:31.980
you know, and I bought
this book in Taiwan.

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:34.140
It's a very thin book,
but it has it all there.

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:36.210
The stages of language acquisition.

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:38.190
And it was, it was clear.

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:40.560
It was like the Gordian knot.

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:42.750
It was like Occam's razor.

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:46.620
It was a simple explanation
of how we learn languages.

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:48.450
It cut through all the other stuff.

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:50.910
Uh, I don't want to get too much into.

